OL,3,GNEWSATaoiseach 'not contemplating'
OL,4,Aseparate Omagh bombing inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest chapter in the inquiry,
OL,7,Fwhich is being heard in Belfast, ended
OL,8,Fthis week. The next chapter is expected
OL,9,Fto begin in the new year.
